Toast stack top 8 might overlap clock/wanted, but transient. Fine.
Mission banner top 28% = 109, overlays mission panel; transient. Fine.

Also the weapon HUD at right 14 might extend x? width 98, right 14 => x732-830, inside 844. Good. Radar at right 16 x722-828. Fine.

Alternatively, in landscape hide weapon HUD when on foot? No.

Let's add. Also maybe the `.hud-top-left` and mission panel overlap? Top-left HUD height around 80, mission panel top100. Good.

